**Strategy Formulation**: 1. Calculate |Ψ(0)|² using the formula |Ψ(0)|² = 1/(π a₀³), with a₀ = 5.29 × 10^{-11} m, by first computing a₀³, then π a₀³, then the reciprocal. 2. Compute the coefficient (2 μ₀ /3), using μ₀ = 4π × 10^{-7}. 3. Compute |I| using the formula |I| = (2 μ₀ /3) μ_p |Ψ(0)|², with μ_p = 1.41 × 10^{-26} J/T, by multiplying the results from steps 1 and 2 with μ_p.
</think>
